# Rust build artifacts (architecture-specific; rebuild on the Raspberry Pi)
**/target/

# Rustfmt backup files
**/*.rs.bk

# Debug symbols sometimes generated on Windows
*.pdb

# Local environment and secret files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor and operating-system files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Keep dependency versions reproducible on the Raspberry Pi.
!**/Cargo.lock
